{"sections":{"main":{"type":"page","settings":{"kicker":"POLÍTICAS DE PRIVACIDAD","kicker_size":9,"show_title":false,"title_size":8,"show_content":true,"content_size":5,"align_text":"text-center","text_color":"text--neutral","bg":"palette--light bg--accent","width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"f72192a5-5be1-411e-ac5b-d5f8eefe4b47":{"type":"section-richtext","blocks":{"template--16757464694996__f72192a5-5be1-411e-ac5b-d5f8eefe4b47-kicker-1":{"type":"kicker","disabled":true,"settings":{"kicker":"Introducing","enable_line":true,"text_size":4}},"template--16757464694996__f72192a5-5be1-411e-ac5b-d5f8eefe4b47-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"SEGURIDAD E INFORMACIÓN","text_size":7}},"template--16757464694996__f72192a5-5be1-411e-ac5b-d5f8eefe4b47-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>La experiencia de comprar en www.froens.cl es cómoda, fácil y segura. La empresa Frøens trabaja con altos estándares de seguridad, por lo tanto, toda la información que los usuarios registran en el sitio se mantienen de forma confidencial.<\/p><p>En Login, registro y comunicación con empresas de medios de pago, Froens usa certificados digitales de seguridad (SSL), con el fin de encriptar comunicación. Froens no manipula ni almacena datos financieros de sus clientes.<\/p><p>Froens adoptará las medidas necesarias y prudentes para resguardar la seguridad de los datos y clave secreta, como sistemas de encriptación de información, certificados de seguridad u otros que la empresa estime pertinente, siempre en pos de la seguridad del consumidor.<\/p>","text_size":4,"text_columns":1}},"template--16757464694996__f72192a5-5be1-411e-ac5b-d5f8eefe4b47-button-1":{"type":"button","disabled":true,"settings":{"link_text_1":"Shop all","link_1":"shopify:\/\/collections\/all","button_size_1":"btn--medium","button_style_1":"btn-text-thick-line","button_color_1":"btn--neutral","link_text_2":"","link_2":"","button_size_2":"btn--medium","button_style_2":"btn-text-thick-line","button_color_2":"btn--neutral","link_text_3":"","link_3":"","button_size_3":"btn--long","button_style_3":"btn-text-thick-line","button_color_3":"btn--white"}}},"block_order":["template--16757464694996__f72192a5-5be1-411e-ac5b-d5f8eefe4b47-kicker-1","template--16757464694996__f72192a5-5be1-411e-ac5b-d5f8eefe4b47-heading-1","template--16757464694996__f72192a5-5be1-411e-ac5b-d5f8eefe4b47-text-1","template--16757464694996__f72192a5-5be1-411e-ac5b-d5f8eefe4b47-button-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"text-left","text_color":"text--neutral","bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","content_width":2000,"width":"wrapper--narrow","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"9f90f497-8696-4a0e-b176-8944166b59ff":{"type":"section-richtext","blocks":{"ea5a1c7d-29ae-4ab3-b745-dc068c1780a2":{"type":"kicker","disabled":true,"settings":{"kicker":"Introducing","enable_line":true,"text_size":4}},"7e173c1b-a809-4e55-a0df-deb0e1a64403":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"DECLARACIÓN DE PRIVACIDAD","text_size":7}},"60eab2c2-6a09-47f5-9b39-c65395dfe335":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Frøens no comparte a terceros los datos personales registrados por sus usuarios en el sitio. Sin embargo, esta información podrá ser usada por Frøens para fines estadísticos y para una mejor comprensión del perfil de sus usuarios y, así, mejorar lo que el sitio ofrece y el sistema de despacho de productos.<\/p>","text_size":4,"text_columns":1}},"7a22a9bc-c813-47bb-83b4-e9a0dbb83e07":{"type":"button","disabled":true,"settings":{"link_text_1":"Shop all","link_1":"shopify:\/\/collections\/all","button_size_1":"btn--medium","button_style_1":"btn-text-thick-line","button_color_1":"btn--neutral","link_text_2":"","link_2":"","button_size_2":"btn--medium","button_style_2":"btn-text-thick-line","button_color_2":"btn--neutral","link_text_3":"","link_3":"","button_size_3":"btn--long","button_style_3":"btn-text-thick-line","button_color_3":"btn--white"}}},"block_order":["ea5a1c7d-29ae-4ab3-b745-dc068c1780a2","7e173c1b-a809-4e55-a0df-deb0e1a64403","60eab2c2-6a09-47f5-9b39-c65395dfe335","7a22a9bc-c813-47bb-83b4-e9a0dbb83e07"],"settings":{"align_text":"text-left","text_color":"text--neutral","bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","content_width":2000,"width":"wrapper--narrow","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"7e27740d-7ffa-411c-98df-eabbfa192ccf":{"type":"section-richtext","blocks":{"a1f9f044-b2ec-4182-a10b-6bd51c3c1aea":{"type":"kicker","disabled":true,"settings":{"kicker":"Introducing","enable_line":true,"text_size":4}},"f3ece6f7-5402-4384-9922-fd5fe83d9686":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"INFORMACIÓN DEL USUARIO","text_size":7}},"da1b9bde-9aa2-402b-a072-60b94c193548":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Al registrarse el sitio sólo se solicitará al usuario aquella información relevante para crear una cuenta. Al momento de efectuar una compra es necesaria información personal para el pago del producto y su envío. Bajo ninguna circunstancia esta información será comunicada o transmitida a terceros ajenos a Frøens. *Frøens no almacena la información de tarjetas bancaria del usuario.<\/p>","text_size":4,"text_columns":1}},"fcf7fa63-6108-4566-ac16-46b1651ec9e6":{"type":"button","disabled":true,"settings":{"link_text_1":"Shop all","link_1":"shopify:\/\/collections\/all","button_size_1":"btn--medium","button_style_1":"btn-text-thick-line","button_color_1":"btn--neutral","link_text_2":"","link_2":"","button_size_2":"btn--medium","button_style_2":"btn-text-thick-line","button_color_2":"btn--neutral","link_text_3":"","link_3":"","button_size_3":"btn--long","button_style_3":"btn-text-thick-line","button_color_3":"btn--white"}}},"block_order":["a1f9f044-b2ec-4182-a10b-6bd51c3c1aea","f3ece6f7-5402-4384-9922-fd5fe83d9686","da1b9bde-9aa2-402b-a072-60b94c193548","fcf7fa63-6108-4566-ac16-46b1651ec9e6"],"settings":{"align_text":"text-left","text_color":"text--neutral","bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","content_width":2000,"width":"wrapper--narrow","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"234ef239-41e6-4836-af73-5ad1b449a3d7":{"type":"section-richtext","blocks":{"1c7eb037-fe37-4e4d-8407-124ca6172b97":{"type":"kicker","disabled":true,"settings":{"kicker":"Introducing","enable_line":true,"text_size":4}},"9f2a7217-691a-49de-b028-415728ee5aea":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"datos personales","text_size":7}},"b9733eab-20bc-4345-ab22-562ed386ca87":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>El usuario registrado podrá ejercer sus derecho de información, modificación, eliminación, cancelación y\/o bloqueo de su cuenta y datos cuando lo desee, según lo establecido por la Ley nª 19.628 sobre la Protección de la Vida Privada. Frøens entrega a sus usuarios una dirección de correo electrónico (ventas@froens.cl) en el caso de necesitar ayuda con su cuenta, además de sistema de pasos simples para modificar y\/o corregir sus datos personales.<\/p>","text_size":4,"text_columns":1}},"ff5f6048-7b04-4a63-a242-4a7c27944558":{"type":"button","disabled":true,"settings":{"link_text_1":"Shop all","link_1":"shopify:\/\/collections\/all","button_size_1":"btn--medium","button_style_1":"btn-text-thick-line","button_color_1":"btn--neutral","link_text_2":"","link_2":"","button_size_2":"btn--medium","button_style_2":"btn-text-thick-line","button_color_2":"btn--neutral","link_text_3":"","link_3":"","button_size_3":"btn--long","button_style_3":"btn-text-thick-line","button_color_3":"btn--white"}}},"block_order":["1c7eb037-fe37-4e4d-8407-124ca6172b97","9f2a7217-691a-49de-b028-415728ee5aea","b9733eab-20bc-4345-ab22-562ed386ca87","ff5f6048-7b04-4a63-a242-4a7c27944558"],"settings":{"align_text":"text-left","text_color":"text--neutral","bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","content_width":2000,"width":"wrapper--narrow","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"ec202ee9-91c8-4acd-ad8e-9615c2568513":{"type":"section-richtext","blocks":{"f3f40fd7-8362-4899-9c08-b220d511ae39":{"type":"kicker","disabled":true,"settings":{"kicker":"Introducing","enable_line":true,"text_size":4}},"0a1b4143-52d